flowchart TD
    A[Population] -->|random sample| B[Sample data]
    B --> C[Point estimate: mean, proportion]
    C --> D[Standard error]
    D --> E[Confidence interval]
    B --> F[State H0 and H1]
    F --> G[Test statistic]
    G --> H[p-value]
    H --> I{"p < alpha?"}
    I -- Yes --> J[Reject H0]
    I -- No --> K[Fail to reject H0]
    J --> L[Check effect size and power]
    K --> L
    L --> M[Decision under uncertainty]
